                <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend.&#xa;Heavy green: writes to the two data-plane boundary files. Heavy purple: batch reads from those files, and noodle-shipper's own OTLP push to the collector's otlp receiver.&#xa;Heavy amber: SQLite read/write within the embellishment plane. Thin grey: OTLP ingress from non-noodle producers and stock collector pipeline stages.&#xa;Correction from the pre-2026-08-11 version of this diagram: noodle DOES speak OTLP (noodle-shipper, crates/noodle-shipper/src/exporter.rs) — there is no filelog receiver tailing noodle's files. The collector remains a separate process; its repository, name, and deployment are ADR 044's concern." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#444444;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4" parent="1" vertex="1">
